        "description": "Cabo Verde's national dish in its full glory — the 'rica' version loaded with every meat available. A slow stew of hominy corn, beans, and whatever the family can afford. Viral food travel content from Cabo Verde always centers on cachupa — the communal pot that defines the islands.",
